    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.99,
      282.52,
      404.47,
      308.55
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Powers of Attorney (Amendment) Act, No\u2026.. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.99,
      319.72,
      404.56,
      407.75
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 2 of the Powers of Attorney Ordinance (Chapter 122) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended in paragraph (b) of the definition of the expression \u201cpower of attorney\u201d thereof, by the substitution for the words \u201cexecuted before two witnesses and an Ambassador\u201d of the words \u201cexecuted before an Ambassador\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.99,
      418.92,
      404.53,
      457.35
    ],
    "text": "3. Section 3D of the principal enactment is hereby amended by the substitution for the words \u201cshall not execute\u201d of the words \u201cshall not execute\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.99,
      468.52,
      404.59,
      519.35
    ],
    "text": "4. Section 4 of the principal enactment is hereby amended by the repeal of paragraph (b) of subsection (1) thereof, and the substitution therefor of the following paragraph:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.99,
      530.68,
      318.51,
      544.15
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(b) execute a document \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      244.2,
      556.52,
      404.24,
      593.45
    ],
    "text": "(i) if it is executed in Sri Lanka before two witnesses and attested by a notary public; or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      244.2,
      606.13,
      404.25,
      667.86
